	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:03,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3240
			},
			"text": " What if I took a swim in a typical spent nuclear fuel pool?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,240",
				"to": "00:00:06,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3240,
				"to": 6320
			},
			"text": " Would I need to dive to actually experience a fatal amount of radiation?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,320",
				"to": "00:00:10,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6320,
				"to": 10220
			},
			"text": " For the kinds of radiation coming off of spent nuclear fuel, every 7 centimeters of water"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,220",
				"to": "00:00:12,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10220,
				"to": 12200
			},
			"text": " cuts the amount of radiation in half."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,200",
				"to": "00:00:16,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12200,
				"to": 16040
			},
			"text": " This absorption means that 2 meters away from the fuel there is a billionth as much radiation"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:16,040",
				"to": "00:00:20,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 16040,
				"to": 20240
			},
			"text": " as directly adjacent to it, and 2 meters farther away than that there is a billionth again"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:20,240",
				"to": "00:00:21,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 20240,
				"to": 21240
			},
			"text": " as much."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,240",
				"to": "00:00:25,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21240,
				"to": 25020
			},
			"text": " Swimming to the bottom, touching your elbows to a fresh fuel canister and then immediately"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:25,020",
				"to": "00:00:27,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 25020,
				"to": 27520
			},
			"text": " swimming back up could be enough to kill you."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:27,520",
				"to": "00:00:31,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 27520,
				"to": 31660
			},
			"text": " Yet outside the safe dose boundary, you could swim around as long as you wanted."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:31,660",
				"to": "00:00:34,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 31660,
				"to": 34760
			},
			"text": " The dose from the rods would be less than the normal background dose of radiation you"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,760",
				"to": "00:00:37,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34760,
				"to": 37120
			},
			"text": " get from cosmic rays and stuff walking around."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:37,120",
				"to": "00:00:41,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 37120,
				"to": 41040
			},
			"text": " If there's corrosion in the spent fuel rod casings, there might be some fission products"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,040",
				"to": "00:00:42,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41040,
				"to": 42040
			},
			"text": " in the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,040",
				"to": "00:00:46,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42040,
				"to": 46000
			},
			"text": " Spent fuel facilities generally do a pretty good job of keeping the water clean, but it's"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:46,000",
				"to": "00:00:48,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 46000,
				"to": 48840
			},
			"text": " radioactive enough that it wouldn't be legal to sell it as bottled water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,840",
				"to": "00:00:52,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48840,
				"to": 52400
			},
			"text": " We know spent fuel pools can be safe-ish to swim in because they're routinely serviced"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:52,400",
				"to": "00:00:53,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 52400,
				"to": 53680
			},
			"text": " by human divers."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,680",
				"to": "00:00:56,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53680,
				"to": 56320
			},
			"text": " However, these divers do have to be careful."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:56,320",
				"to": "00:01:01,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 56320,
				"to": 61240
			},
			"text": " On August 31, 2010, a diver was servicing the spent fuel pool at the Leibstadt Nuclear"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,240",
				"to": "00:01:02,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61240,
				"to": 62680
			},
			"text": " Reactor in Switzerland."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:02,680",
				"to": "00:01:06,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 62680,
				"to": 66200
			},
			"text": " He spotted an unidentified length of tubing at the bottom of the pool and asked a supervisor"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,200",
				"to": "00:01:07,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66200,
				"to": 67200
			},
			"text": " what to do."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:07,200",
				"to": "00:01:09,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 67200,
				"to": 69720
			},
			"text": " He was told to put it in his tool basket, which he did."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:09,720",
				"to": "00:01:13,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 69720,
				"to": 73180
			},
			"text": " Due to bubble noise in the pool, he didn't hear his radiation alarm."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:13,180",
				"to": "00:01:17,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 73180,
				"to": 77000
			},
			"text": " The object turned out to be a piece of protective tubing from a radiation monitor in the reactor"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:17,000",
				"to": "00:01:19,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 77000,
				"to": 79760
			},
			"text": " core made highly radioactive by neutron flux."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,760",
				"to": "00:01:23,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79760,
				"to": 83920
			},
			"text": " As it was, the water protected him, and only his hand, which is a body part more resistant"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,920",
				"to": "00:01:27,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83920,
				"to": 87640
			},
			"text": " to radiation than the delicate internal organs, received a heavy dose."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:27,640",
				"to": "00:01:31,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 87640,
				"to": 91480
			},
			"text": " So as far as swimming safety goes, the bottom line is that you'd probably be okay as long"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:31,480",
				"to": "00:01:35,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 91480,
				"to": 95360
			},
			"text": " as you didn't dive to the bottom, or pick up anything strange, or drink too much of"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:35,360",
				"to": "00:01:35,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 95360,
				"to": 95880
			},
			"text": " the water."
		}
	]
}
